{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"Eliza comes and kills the lights\n\nIn udder darkness, Eliza face glows slightly from something in her palms. Then the lights get brighter, Eliza starts doing a form of a dance the lights start leaving her palms and hover. you realize it's a much tamer version of guiding bolt. \n\nMusic starts slowly, primarily drums with some strings until it gets obvious. The lights start making shapes, making faces. Eliza moving in a dance still but can also be noticeably focusing on the lights movements.  The music gets more dramatic until the light balls flies above the crowd and goes straight up. In a few seconds they pop with a final crescendo in the music and light sparks falls onto the crowd.\n\nEliza bows with a giant smile. She's obviously just happy to be here. She starts walking off.","created_at":"2021-07-23T03:19:46.741000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867969214147878912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
