{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"~~**1. 1000g**~~\n~~**2.Darling's Duster** Wondrous Item (requires attunement) A maroon duster with mustard yellow silk lining covered in a paisley pattern of teal and aqua. The coat has four large pockets on the interior of the coat, each is large enough for a standard book. Stitched into one of the pockets is the word \"Bookworm.\" As the coattails flow near the floor wisps of smoke or mist (your choice) pour from beneath. While you are attuned to this item you can cast Fog Cloud at will, (1st level version, centered on yourself). Once per day you may cast gaseous form on yourself, this ability recharges at dawn.~~","created_at":"2021-07-23T03:24:52.865000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T03:42:42.388000Z","id":"867970498124988446","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"~~**3. Ka-zoom** Bardic instrument (requires attunement by a bard) This magical kazoo add +1 to your Spell Attack bonus and spell save DC while attuned to it.As a bonus action you can blow into the Ka-zoom to cast Haste on yourself. The effect persists for a number of rounds equal to your Con modifier (minimum of 1)~~","created_at":"2021-07-23T03:25:38.164000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T03:33:08.933000Z","id":"867970688122761276","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"~~**4. Penney’s Peerless Power Polishes**-Wondrous item (consumable) A brand of black market nail polish often used to smuggle magic into places where it aught not belong. Mixed with a dash of powdered lead to block magic detection from spells and abilities that would do so. You can only cast these spells once per application and only one color may be applied at a time. Each bottle has 5 applications.Currently on the market there are only six colors each with their own effect: *Cat’s Paw Purple*: Display how safe and innocent you are with a simple flourish of your hand, before striking your foe. You can cast Hypnotic Pattern(3rd level, DC14).~~","created_at":"2021-07-23T03:26:15.028000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T03:41:01.725000Z","id":"867970842741596180","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"~~**5. Gaillardia’s Healing Salve** (consumable)This jar contains a greasy, yellow, jellylike substance. A single application of healing salve smeared across a wound heals 1d8+1 points of damage. A double application heals 2d8+3 points of damage. A triple application heals 3d8+5 points of damage. No matter how much salve is used, each application takes a standard action to apply. A 3-inch-diameter, 2-inch-deep jar holds enough salve for ten single applications.~~","created_at":"2021-07-23T03:27:01.645000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T03:32:23.379000Z","id":"867971038267465818","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"**6.Oil of Slipperiness Potion**, uncommon (consumable) This sticky black unguent is thick and heavy in the container, but it flows quickly when poured. The oil can cover a Medium or smaller creature, along with the equipment it’s wearing and carrying (one additional vial is required for each size category above Medium). Applying the oil takes 10 minutes. The affected creature then gains the effect of a freedom of movement spell for 8 hours.Alternatively, the oil can be poured on the ground as an action, where it covers a 10-foot square, duplicating the effect of the grease spell in that area for 8 hours.","created_at":"2021-07-23T03:27:35.432000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T03:30:25.473000Z","id":"867971179980415006","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
